"game.instructions" = "Choose a tool and click Start playing. Press on a drift and roll a snowball to make it bigger. Pick it up and flick it toward the imaginary glass: it will leave a snowy splash that melts away. Release gently to build a snowman. Use the mitten to push snow or pick up and move a handful. Esc to exit.";
"game.stacking" = "Place a second ball on the first, then a third on the second. Balls snap into place and shrink to fit when needed. The third gets a face, carrot nose, and bucket hat. Clear the snow underneath and the snowman drops as one piece.";
"game.limits" = "Up to 30 balls and 5 snowmen per display. Ball radius ranges from 6 to 40 pt. A ball stops growing when there is no more snow.";
"game.delete" = "Choose Remove object or right-click a ball in play mode. Melt all snow removes every ball and snowman. Press Esc to return to normal clicks.";
"game.limit" = "Limit reached: 30 balls or 5 snowmen per display";
"game.noSnow" = "Not enough snow here to make a snowball";
